    "text": "The built-in library is organised into layout, form, display, feedback, data, navigation, utility, chart, animation, editor, 3D and smart components. Start with the role you need rather than a list of every property.\n\nThis is a guide to finding a component, not a complete property reference. Every name below is registered in `@softn/components`; for exact properties and callback values, read a working example or the component’s source."
