    "text": "Client app | Private deployment\nRenders forms, lists and controls | Authorises requests and enforces access rules\nCollects and validates input for usability | Validates input before using private resources\nCalls supported backend operations | Owns private credentials and server database access\nDisplays success or failure | Defines the operation’s durable result and errors\n\nA server resource packaged for deployment is not a script the browser runs. The client should know which operation to request, not carry a private database or service secret."
