    "text": "For custom server logic and SQLite, configure those resources on the hosting platform and expose the operations the client needs. Keep private scripts, credentials and databases on the server.\n\nFormLogic fetches verified ZIPP engine bytes once per page and gives each isolated execution context its own copy, instance, memory and permissions. Shared engine delivery is not a shared app-data context."
