    "text": "- Preview: Try the current app while editing it.\n- Run: Use an app in its execution environment.\n- Save project: Keep the editable work in the creation workflow; confirm the tool’s actual storage behaviour.\n- Export bundle: Create the portable .softn file you can inspect and reopen.\n- Publish: Use the selected host’s publication workflow to make an app available there.\n\nThis vocabulary helps users recognise what they have actually done. The exact controls and availability depend on the tool and host, so avoid presenting a local export as a completed public deployment."
